es\"><img alt=\"Stage Mines icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mines icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mines_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Stage_Mines_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172320\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarred_Womb\" title=\"Scarred Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/af/Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073303\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p>The <b>Faceless</b> is a monster added in <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Repentance\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Repentance\">The Binding of Isaac: Repentance</a></i>. It takes on the appearance of a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaper\" title=\"Gaper\"><img alt=\"Gaper\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gaper.png\" data-image-key=\"Gaper.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3b/Gaper.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20210821090455\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gaper\" title=\"Gaper\">Gaper</a> with most of its head cut off, but with its entire spine still intact. Initially, it wanders around the room aimlessly, occasionally firing out 6 blood shots in a hexagonal shape. Once it takes damage or if Isaac gets close to it, it starts to chase him and fires shots much more frequently. Upon death, it may turn into a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer\" title=\"Pacer\"><img alt=\"Pacer\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pacer.png\" data-image-key=\"Pacer.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/0c/Pacer.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821090428\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer\" title=\"Pacer\">Pacer</a> or &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer#Gusher\" title=\"Pacer\"><img alt=\"Gusher\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gusher.png\" data-image-key=\"Gusher.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/bf/Gusher.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/18?cb=20210821085825\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pacer#Gusher\" title=\"Pacer\">Gusher</a> but more often the latter.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tainted_Faceless\">Tainted Faceless</span></h3><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"T\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat T.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_T.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/d/dd/Font_TeamMeat_T.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822055957\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"a\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-na