          <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">100</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>827.1</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\"><img alt=\"Stage Mines icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mines icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mines_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Stage_Mines_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172320\" /></a></span><br />Found on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ascent\" title=\"Ascent\">Ascent</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Home\" title=\"Home\">Home</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>The Tainted Faceless</b> appears to be a Fatty version of the Faceless, with its lower jaw including teeth still intact.\n</p><p>The Tainted Faceless walks towards Isaac while rapidly releasing volleys of 6 blood shots in a hexagonal shape. It essentially behaves like the Faceless with higher health and faster attack rate.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Faceless\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Faceless\">Faceless</a> originate from the <i>Antibirth</i> mod.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></